xpected pmol/L after changing Estradiol unit in Settings > Calibration > Calibration settings. observed_quote \"Target 100–200 pg/mL\". Include steps and mention Calibration screen target range shows 367–734 pmol/L, Home stays pg/mL.\n\nLet's file."}
