, preset doses, empty name/empty-invalid strength validation, duplicate creation, display-name/strength edits, removal from group.\n- **Settings:** Body weight bottom-sheet editor (Clear confirmation, Cancel revert, empty save, 0 kg rejected, 1000 kg accepted, kg↔lb conversion/save/round-trip, rotation while open), First day of week (Default→Saturday→Default with Plan week start following), Hide reference ranges (Home target pill hide/restore), Dark mode (Always on→Follow system), whole Settings list, Calibration units, custom analyte add/edit/archive and its validation.\n\n**Recommendation:** the device/session needs to be re-established; the one confirmed caption inconsistency is already logged, and the form-switch edge case (Injection → Gel while adding a medicine) still needs finishing."}
